    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d320">

                <pb facs="0440" n="334" sameAs="frus:frus1906p1/pg334"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Minister Rockhill to
                        the Secretary of State.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Extract.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >American Legation</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Peking</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1906-04-02"
                                ><hi rendition="#italic">April 2, 1906</hi></date>.</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 272.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: In further reference to the matter of the
                    Nan-chang Fu massacre, concerning which I sent you in my dispatch No. 260 of
                    March 17 a semiofficial statement, I have now the honor to transmit a copy of a
                    dispatch received from our consul-general at Hankow. I some time ago instructed
                    Mr. Martin to secure for me all the information he could on this occurrence.</p>
                <p>I have, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">W. W. Rockhill.</hi></signed></closer>



                <xi:include href="d320-a1.xml" xpointer="d320-a1"/>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
